{"id":"wb-8-289","name":"余姚通济桥","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"通济桥 (余姚市)","text":"通济桥，又名舜江桥、老江桥，是中国浙江省余姚市城区姚江上的一座三孔石拱桥。桥梁始建于北宋，现存桥梁建于清代，有“浙东第一桥”之称。桥梁与北岸的舜江楼形成“长虹腾空，飞阁镇流”的景观，成为余姚历史文化的象征。通济桥于2019年被列入全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%80%9A%E6%B5%8E%E6%A1%A5_(%E4%BD%99%E5%A7%9A%E5%B8%82)","revisionId":92163744,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92163744","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/1a8826071fa2b94ea5020e1d.jpg","title":"Tongji_Bridge_and_Shunjiang_Building,_2014-08-02_14.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tongji_Bridge_and_Shunjiang_Building,_2014-08-02_14.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/08/Tongji_Bridge_and_Shunjiang_Building%2C_2014-08-02_14.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​通济桥和舜江楼","width":320,"height":213}}